Logos in this folder, and where they come from. Every file is used unmodified (SVGs that shipped wrapped in a JS
string were unwrapped to plain SVG). The marks belong to their owners; they appear here only to name each service.

1. SVGs (*.svg): @web3icons/core 4.0.58, dist/svgs/{networks,tokens,exchanges,wallets}/branded,
   https://github.com/0xa3k5/web3icons, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024 0xa3k5 (full text below).
2. Wallet app icons (*.png), each from the wallet's own open-source repository, under that repository's licence:
   - zodl.png      zodl-inc/zodl-ios, secant/Resources/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/144.png (MIT)
   - keystone.png  zodl-inc/zodl-ios, secant/Resources/Assets.xcassets/Partners/keystoneLogo.imageset (MIT)
   - zingo.png     zingolabs/zingo-mobile, ios/Zingo/Images.xcassets/AppIcon-Prod.appiconset/Icon-128.png (MIT)
   - zkool.png     hhanh00/zkool2, macos/Runner/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/app_icon_128.png (MIT)
   - ywallet.png   hhanh00/zwallet, android/app/src/main/res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/launcher_icon.png (MIT)
   - edge.png      EdgeApp/edge-react-gui, android/app/src/main/res/mipmap-hdpi/ic_launcher_round.png (BSD-3-Clause)
   - cake.png      cake-tech/cake_wallet, assets/images/cakewallet_android_icon/mipmap-xxhdpi/ic_launcher.png (MIT)
   - vultisig.png  vultisig/vultisig-ios, VultisigApp/VultisigApp/Assets.xcassets/AppIconMacOS.appiconset/Vultisig128.png (Apache-2.0)
   Gem (GPL-3.0), Brave (MPL-2.0), Keystone's own repository (licence unclear) and Unstoppable (vector-only icon) are
   not copied; those wallets show a letter instead.

